<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25934" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lāser</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lāsar</span></b> ), ĕris,
			n., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the juice of the plant</i> laserpitium, <i>assafœtida</i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">laser e silphio profluens,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					22, 23, 49, § 101</span></i>
			; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cujus sucum vocant laser,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					19, 3, 15, § 38</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">laser Cyrenaicum vino diluere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					Arb. 23</span></i>
			.—Jestingly of Maecenas: laser Arretinum, Aug. ap.
					<i><span class="en">Macr. S. 2, 4, 12</span></i>.
			—Form lasar: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lasaris radix,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Apic. 8,
					7</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Meton.</b>, <i>the plant</i>
			laserpitium <i>itself</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">laseris radix,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					19, 8, 43, § 153</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Scrib. Comp. 192</span></i>: 196. </div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
